{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou are an expert translation assistant. Translate from german to english. Paraphrase and use synonyms where possible.\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Prompt: Erkl\u00e4re einem zehnj\u00e4hrigen Kind, wie die Fotosynthese funktioniert."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"translation":{"type":"string"}},"required":["translation"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}